  "description": "Reference external AIKernel Capability module for Windows win-x64, LibTorch 2.12.0, and CUDA 13.0. Exposes load_model, unload_model, and forward operations through AIKernel Capability contracts while keeping CUDA and Native ABI implementation outside AIKernel.Core. The NuGet package is lightweight and dynamically links external LibTorch/CUDA runtime paths through loader.json.",
